id: limited-range-reading
name: Limited Range Reading
restriction: true
reduction: 2
# "You can only target Characters within your Melee Range for the effects of Mind Reading."
mindMeleeOnly: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mind Reading only reaches a Character within your Melee Range.
text: >
  Limited Range Reading: Your ability to read minds has a limited effective range.
  –Locked Advancements: N/A
  –TP Cost: -2
  –Effect: You can only target Characters within your Melee Range for the effects of Mind Reading.
